:"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T14:16:34Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T14:16:34Z","body":"I can confirm this is happening, I just put the texture from the MRP on a Sprite3D to see it easily.\n\n> Godot v4.5.beta (e49bcdf23) - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti (nvidia; 570.133.07) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.28 GiB memory","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3049154590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050482183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108406#issuecomment-3050482183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108406","id":3050482183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc610qoH","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T22:45:52Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T22:47:27Z","body":"The `compress/normal_map` option only affects textures with the VRAM Compressed or Basis Universal compression modes. When enabled (or detected), it will use a RG VRAM compression format for better quality (since the blue channel is unused). You can technically use it for other purposes if you only need the red and green channels from the texture too.\n\nIt has no effect with other compression modes, and it can't until support for uncompressed RG image formats is added (remember that lossy/lossless are still uncompressed on the GPU side).\n\nTherefore, the option should remain hidden outside of the VRAM Compressed and Basis Universal modes, but we should make sure its value is properly ignored when not in those modes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050482183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050607903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108406#issuecomment-3050607903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108406","id":3050607903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc611JUf","user":{"login":"wagnerfs","id":106078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjA3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs","html_url":"https://github.com/wagnerfs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T23:53:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T13:44:12Z","body":"@Calinou here's the catch, even normal maps set as Lossless when imported to materials will get their `compress/normal_map` set to 1, which's extra confusing, because assuming I dragged/dropped an albedo on a normal map slot, it'll still be changed to normal_map with no way of changing back until we swap to Lossy or anything else, set it to detect or disabled again and then changed back to Lossless.\n\nSo honestly, no matter the use case or logics behind it, flags are still being set and read internally. I assume making it so internally it'd always be read as \"detect\" would make things even worse.\n\nI'd honestly as of now just allow the user to edit that flag in the importer until a proper internal fix is done, because otherwise, it's creating a whole new problem to the user (like it did to me) by hidding the actual editor problem/solution. I had to resort to bulk text match/replace for a fix\n\nEDIT:\nI kinda forgot to add, even though Lossy is also uncompressed on the GPU, `compress/normal_map` flag is available on it, which makes Lossless not having it no sense.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050607903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]